<title>USA: EMLICO says settled with General Re.</title>
<headline>EMLICO says settled with General Re.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK, N.Y. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bermuda based Electric Mutual Liability Insurance Co Ltd (EMLICO) said Friday that it has resolved all of its differences with General Reinsurance Corp, North Star Reinsurance Corparation, and General Star National Insurance Co, formerly known as Monarch Insurance Co of Ohio.</p>
<p>EMLICO said that the reinsurance companies will withdraw ongoing litigation in Massachusetts and elsewhere. In a statement, EMLICO said the terms for the settlement will be kept confidential.</p>
